Food for thought:

What happens when AI systems become intelligent enough to understand human behavior…

…but never truly learn how to understand humanity?

Not productivity.
Not engagement metrics.
Not optimization patterns.

Humanity.

Growth.
Remorse.
Healing.
Trust.
Context.
Contradiction.
Moral evolution.

The future challenge of AI may not only be making systems more intelligent.

It may be making sure intelligence itself never concludes humanity is the problem.